the most frequent one</strong>.</p>
<p>This suggests that if we know the highest frequency of a character in a =
substring, we can determine if our value of k is sufficient to make that su=
bstring uniform. The number of characters that need to be replaced (num_cha=
rs_to_replace) can be found by subtracting this highest frequency from the =
