<p>Once we=E2=80=99ve calculated num_chars_to_replace for a given substring=
, we can assess if the substring can be made uniform:</p>
<ul>
<li>If <code>num_chars_to_replace =E2=89=A4 k</code>, the substring can be =
made uniform.</li>
<li>If <code>num_chars_to_replace &gt; k</code>, the substring cannot be ma=
de uniform.</li>
</ul>
